  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "7525401",
      "subQuestName": "(test)隐藏$HIDDEN",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "752540309"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "752540309": {
            "id": "752540309",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "好吧，那你的眼睛是怎么回事？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "752540310"
            ]
          },
          "752540310": {
            "id": "752540310",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "泰克胡",
            "text": "哼哼，是一个光头干的，他在我身上留下了这印迹…他现在也在这个岛上，哼，我会好好「感谢」他的。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "752540311"
            ]
          },
          "752540311": {
            "id": "752540311",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "泰克胡",
            "text": "我知道听了我的故事，您一定也想为我复仇吧？但不必了！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "752540312"
            ]
          },
          "752540312": {
            "id": "752540312",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "泰克胡",
            "text": "亲爱的朋友，在这个如此美丽的夏日，没有人应该感到悲伤。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "752540313"
            ]
          },
          "752540313": {
            "id": "752540313",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "泰克胡",
            "text": "请享用我为每位客人准备的欢迎果汁，尽情挥霍这段休闲的时光吧。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "752540314"
            ]
          },
          "752540314": {
            "id": "752540314",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "泰克胡",
            "text": "果汁就在那边的橱柜上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7525402",
      "subQuestName": "(test)隐藏$HIDDEN",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "752540201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "752540201": {
            "id": "752540201",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "泰克胡",
            "text": "亲爱的朋友，既然你喝了我的欢迎果汁，那让我给你一个忠告。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "752540202"
            ]
          },
          "752540202": {
            "id": "752540202",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "泰克胡",
            "text": "要是你只是个过来享受假期的普通人，那就别靠近提提岛的最北边，那里没有能让你放松的东西。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7525403",
      "subQuestName": "(test)隐藏$HIDDEN",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7525401",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "752540101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "752540101": {
            "id": "752540101",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "泰克胡",
            "text": "嚯，朋友！欢迎来到梦中的帕依提提——提提岛！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "752540102"
            ]
          },
          "752540102": {
            "id": "752540102",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "泰克胡",
            "text": "往前走就是「醅蜜」酒吧和「尝露」酒吧，我是酒吧的迎宾泰克胡。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7525404",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "752540409"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "752540409": {
            "id": "752540409",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "再见。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "752540410"
            ]
          },
          "752540410": {
            "id": "752540410",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "泰克胡",
            "text": "你还没问我的眼睛是怎么回事呢…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7525405",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "752540509"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "752540509": {
            "id": "752540509",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "我们好像在哪见过？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "752540501"
            ]
          },
          "752540501": {
            "id": "752540501",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "泰克胡",
            "text": "朋友，这是命运给不凡之人打上的标记，让您与我初次相遇，也如同久别重逢。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "752540502"
            ]
          },
          "752540502": {
            "id": "752540502",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "泰克胡",
            "text": "看到我这恶狼般的眼罩，想必就已经意识到了我的不凡了吧？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7525406",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "752540603"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "752540603": {
            "id": "752540603",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "泰克胡",
            "text": "哦？您问我泰克胡的眼睛？哈哈，这是男人一生必须修炼的三件事。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "752540604"
            ]
          },
          "752540604": {
            "id": "752540604",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "泰克胡",
            "text": "第一，一具饱经风霜的身体，至少要有一道伤疤，否则就不能暗示这个男人曾经历过的复杂人生，这使他失去厚度。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "752540605"
            ]
          },
          "752540605": {
            "id": "752540605",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "泰克胡",
            "text": "第二，用服装或者饰品遮住伤疤，保持低调但不要全部遮住，否则旁人就无法意识到这个男人的特殊。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "752540606"
            ]
          },
          "752540606": {
            "id": "752540606",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "泰克胡",
            "text": "第三…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "752540607"
            ]
          },
          "752540607": {
            "id": "752540607",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "停一下，我根本没有问你的眼睛。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "752540608"
            ]
          },
          "752540608": {
            "id": "752540608",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "泰克胡",
            "text": "是吧？没错！这就是我要说的第三点：如果旁人还是没有注意到，一定要想办法主动提起…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
